# Market Gnome's second ability is about exile, not about leaving the battlefield while a craft ability is activated (CR 603.2).
# On turn three Bot1 crafts Dire Flail and pays for it partly with a Phyrexian Altar that sacrifices the Gnome as a mana
# ability while the craft ability is being activated: the Gnome dies in the middle of the activation (CR 605.3a), so its first
# ability triggers - once - and its second does not. Bot1 gains 1 life and draws one card, and the Mox Pearl chosen as the
# material is the only card exiled besides the Flail.

